    {
      "id": "opera-q01",
      "question": "四大徽班指哪四个戏班？它们进京与京剧形成是什么关系？",
      "annotationStatus": "assistant_source_checked_candidate",
      "expectInsufficient": false,
      "idempotencyKey": "eval-d11835ca4fb445698be5b220b87e86c5-6e72e2620751eeb8",
      "attempts": 1,
      "status": "response_received",
      "startedAt": "2026-10-10T13:25:40.201311+08:00",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "headerRequestId": "8b9eeebf-919d-4546-afa2-a9e31eb3de0f",
      "rawResponseSHA256": "7dccbdc6d2a0d774e736d022d02eeed80a519c9144ec2dc0744a20171aed27ba",
      "response": {
        "answer": "四大徽班指的是三庆、四喜、春台、和春这四个徽班[chunk_dea75128ab6aa601ff5e9b1e832fe7fc598e7c8c5bee3721e9930f9b402e9826]。它们进京后，与汉调艺人合作，并吸收了昆曲、秦腔等艺术因素，这一过程是京剧形成的重要发展节点[chunk_dea75128ab6aa601ff5e9b1e832fe7fc598e7c8c5bee3721e9930f9b402e9826]。需要说明的是，徽班进京只是京剧形成过程中的一个节点，并不等于京剧在某一日就完成了剧种形成，京剧的形成是清代剧种交流的长期过程[chunk_dea75128ab6aa601ff5e9b1e832fe7fc598e7c8c5bee3721e9930f9b402e9826]。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "id": "chunk_dea75128ab6aa601ff5e9b1e832fe7fc598e7c8c5bee3721e9930f9b402e9826",
            "title": "京剧",
            "sourceId": "ihchina-jingju",
            "locator": "项目正文第一段 · 入库片段 1/1",
            "url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project_details/13201",
            "excerpt": "京剧形成于清代的剧种交流过程。\n三庆、四喜、春台、和春徽班进京后，与汉调艺人合作，并吸收昆曲、秦腔等艺术因素。\n徽班进京是发展节点，不能等同于一日完成剧种形成。",
            "contentKind": "original_fact_summary"
          }
        ],
        "uncertain": false,
        "requestId": "8b9eeebf-919d-4546-afa2-a9e31eb3de0f"
      },
